data: {"id": "7e74414175ee413f-thinking-parallel_evidence-2836", "run_id": "7e74414175ee413f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 结果分析\n\n## 已采集的关键事实\n\n### 1. Pod 事件 (Events)\n- **关键事件**: `Warning / FailedCreatePodSandBox`，根本原因是 `NoNetworkFound`\n- **错误原文**: `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io 'unavailable-network' not found`\n- **频率**: 事件持续约 97 分钟（从 60m 前到 3m39s 前，聚合 426 次）\n- **直接原因**: Pod 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition (NAD) `unavailable-network`，Multus CNI 无法找到该 NAD 资源\n\n### 2. Pod YAML 配置\n- **nodeName**: `node2`\n- **phase**: `Pending`\n- **容器 app**: 镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，未设", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788784120466, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

